+    // PATCHED (bots/patches/01-*): the server builds the player AABB from a
+    // FLOAT width (0.6f), i.e. half width Math.fround(0.3) = 0.30000001192092896,
+    // which is LARGER than 0.3. When we clip the player flush against a block
+    // face using 0.3, the server sees the player 1.19e-8 *inside* that block,
+    // ServerGamePacketListenerImpl.isPlayerCollidingWithAnythingNew() fires and
+    // it silently teleports us back to lastGood{X,Y,Z} with zero velocity --
+    // every tick, forever. The bot then never falls, onGround stays false and
+    // it is frozen. Match the server's half width and keep a 1e-7 margin.
+    playerHalfWidth: Math.fround(0.3) + 1e-7,
